进5，炮八平九，车1平2，车九平八，车8进1，马七进五，炮2进5，兵五进一，卒7平6，兵五进一，卒6平5，炮九平五，象5退3，马五进六，马3进5，马六进七，炮8平5，炮五进五，象7进5，车二进三，马5退3，车二退二，红方优势。\n(2)车四平二，卒7平6，炮五进一，卒6进l，车九进一，卒6进l，帅五平四，车8进1，车九平三，车8平6，帅四平五，车6进1，兵五进一，卒5进1，车三进八，士4进5，车三平二，炮8平7，后车平五，车1平4，车二退七，红方先手。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"0:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment41:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment41","raw_text":"红方优势。","text":"红方优势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":41,"anchor_node_id":"0:41","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_39:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_39","raw_text":"红方先手。","text":"红方先手。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":39,"anchor_node_id":"1:39","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_pver":["091016"],"DhtmlXQ_viewurl":["?owner=u&id=69525&f=&isSave="],"DhtmlXQ_adddate":["2008-2-24 22:50:00"],"DhtmlXQ_editdate":["2008-2-24 22:50:00"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["实战布局琐谈 三、中炮过河车新型夹马对屏风马"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"],"DhtmlXQ_firstnum":["0"],"DhtmlXQ_length":["0"],"DhtmlXQ_type":["全局"],"DhtmlXQ_gametype":["慢棋"],"DhtmlXQ_open":[""],"DhtmlXQ_class":["象棋谱大全-现代棋书专集"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["弈林新编-杨官璘著"],"DhtmlXQ_group":[""],"DhtmlXQ_round":["2.象棋基本知识"],"DhtmlXQ_table":[""],"DhtmlXQ_date":[""],"DhtmlXQ_place":[""],"DhtmlXQ_timerule":[""],"DhtmlXQ_red":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redeng":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redtime":[""],"DhtmlXQ_black":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackeng":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blacktime":[""],"DhtmlXQ_result":[""],"DhtmlXQ_endtype":[""],"DhtmlXQ_remark":["杨官璘"],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_refer":[""],"DhtmlXQ_other":[" "],"DhtmlXQ_hits":["975"],"DhtmlXQ_price":["1"],"DhtmlXQ_owner":["象棋谱大全"],"DhtmlXQ_oldowner":["象棋谱大全"],"DhtmlXQ_hidden":["0"]},"source_tag_count":45,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to